WEBVTT

00:04:28.196 --> 00:04:30.807
(Smeh)

00:04:31.172 --> 00:04:33.434
Crna čokolada,

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:36.156
i dete sa nogama do pazuha.

00:04:36.546 --> 00:04:40.656
I moj prvi nastup bio je
u plesnoj školi Džudimar

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:45.109
u crvenoj kariranoj majici,

00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:48.466
farmerkama sa tregerima, rozim baletankama

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:53.101
i plesali smo uz "I'm an Old Cowhand
from the Rio Grande."

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.990
Volela sam svaki minut.

00:04:56.014 --> 00:04:58.824
Mislim bukvalno sam volela
svaki minut toga,

00:04:58.848 --> 00:05:01.006
naročito kada sam čula aplauz,